1
00:01:52,920 --> 00:01:54,480
- Two little bees~
- Two little bees~
-两只小蜜蜂啊
-两只小蜜蜂啊

2
00:01:54,560 --> 00:01:55,920
- Flying among the flowers~
- Flying among the flowers~
-飞到花丛中啊
-飞到花丛中啊

3
00:01:56,000 --> 00:01:57,560
- Left they fly, right they fly~
- Left they fly, right they fly~
-左飞飞，右飞飞
-左飞飞，右飞飞

4
00:01:58,920 --> 00:02:00,240
- Nice!
- Drink…
-漂亮
-喝…

5
00:02:00,320 --> 00:02:01,560
- Two little bees~
- Two little bees~
-两只小蜜蜂啊
-两只小蜜蜂啊

6
00:02:01,640 --> 00:02:03,320
- Come on.
- Flying among the flowers~
-来
-飞到花丛中啊

7
00:02:03,400 --> 00:02:04,880
- Left they fly~
- Left they fly~
-左飞飞
-左飞飞

8
00:02:05,600 --> 00:02:06,680
Drink up.
喝酒吧

9
00:02:08,320 --> 00:02:09,479
President Lu, what are you up to?
卢总干啥呢？

10
00:02:09,560 --> 00:02:11,880
- There's still booze left, come on…
- How about we each drink half?
-还剩酒呢，快…
-一人喝一半好不好？

11
00:02:11,960 --> 00:02:13,440
Any more and it'll drink us to death.
再喝真的要醉死人的啊

12
00:02:13,520 --> 00:02:15,320
What'd you spend your money coming here for?
你花钱来这干啥来了？

13
00:02:15,400 --> 00:02:17,640
If you don't get drunk, you've wasted it. Come on.
不醉不是白花钱了吗？ 快

14
00:02:17,720 --> 00:02:19,080
I'll drink for Brother Lu.
我替卢哥喝

15
00:02:20,240 --> 00:02:22,280
Little sister-in-law's the one who looks out for big brother.
还是小嫂子向着哥啊

16
00:02:22,360 --> 00:02:23,520
Little sister-in-law?
小嫂子？

17
00:02:25,600 --> 00:02:26,600
Hey.
嗨

18
00:02:29,560 --> 00:02:31,160
Wait for me a moment, Miss Shen.
妳等我一下，沉小姐

19
00:02:31,240 --> 00:02:32,280
Wait for me.
等我一下

20
00:02:34,360 --> 00:02:35,320
Come on, little sister-in-law.
来，小嫂子

21
00:02:35,400 --> 00:02:36,360
Let's you and me drink.
咱俩喝

22
00:02:39,920 --> 00:02:41,560
- One more round.
- One more round.
-再来一盘
-再来一盘

23
00:02:45,080 --> 00:02:46,200
Right now?
现在吗？

24
00:02:46,800 --> 00:02:48,080
Is that alright…
方便…

25
00:02:49,200 --> 00:02:50,120
Okay.
好

26
00:02:51,560 --> 00:02:52,600
Okay.
好

27
00:02:52,680 --> 00:02:53,680
I'll come alone.
我一个人过来

28
00:02:54,280 --> 00:02:55,120
Okay.
好

29
00:02:55,640 --> 00:02:56,520
Okay.
好

30
00:02:57,080 --> 00:02:58,160
Wait for me.
妳等我

31
00:03:02,160 --> 00:03:03,520
Who was that, President Lu?
谁呀，卢总？

32
00:03:05,400 --> 00:03:08,000
Do I need to report to you?
我需要向妳汇报吗？

33
00:03:08,080 --> 00:03:09,920
No. Just asking.
不用，随便问问

34
00:03:19,520 --> 00:03:21,120
What's this supposed to mean?
这是啥意思？

35
00:03:26,960 --> 00:03:28,560
Just a little something.
小意思

36
00:03:50,680 --> 00:03:51,680
Miss Shen.
沉小姐

37
00:03:53,320 --> 00:03:54,560
Get in.
上车

38
00:04:30,640 --> 00:04:34,160
I really didn't expect you'd come to me on your own.
真没想到妳会主动找我啊

39
00:04:38,800 --> 00:04:40,240
I've thought it through.
我想明白了

40
00:04:40,960 --> 00:04:43,400
Yin Hong was creating an opportunity for me.
殷红是在给我创造机会

41
00:04:45,640 --> 00:04:47,320
You won't have to stay in the dorm anymore.
妳以后不用再住宿舍了

42
00:04:47,800 --> 00:04:49,640
That suite of mine at the Jinhao—
我在金豪那个套房

43
00:04:50,120 --> 00:04:52,040
you can move in anytime you like.
妳随时可以过去住的啊

44
00:04:58,120 --> 00:05:01,280
So tonight, you'll come to my place—
那么今晚妳去我那边

45
00:05:02,680 --> 00:05:03,720
is that okay?
可以吗？

46
00:05:06,400 --> 00:05:09,320
Could you come with me to my friend's first to pick up some books?
能先陪我去我朋友那拿几本书吗？

47
00:05:09,400 --> 00:05:11,040
I need them for class tomorrow.
我明天上课要用

48
00:05:14,240 --> 00:05:15,400
Sure.
可以啊

49
00:05:23,000 --> 00:05:28,000
(Imperial Video Screening Room)
（皇朝录像厅）

50
00:05:39,600 --> 00:05:41,280
Your friend's not home?
妳朋友不在啊？

51
00:05:42,640 --> 00:05:45,120
She went home for a few days.
她这几天回家了

52
00:05:53,240 --> 00:05:54,560
Have a seat for a bit.
你先坐一会吧

53
00:05:55,200 --> 00:05:56,120
Okay.
好

54
00:06:18,400 --> 00:06:20,560
I know this movie star well.
这个明星我很熟啊

55
00:06:20,640 --> 00:06:22,680
We often go out for tea together.
我们经常一起出来喝茶的

56
00:06:25,680 --> 00:06:26,800
Is that so?
是吗？

57
00:06:28,320 --> 00:06:30,920
When there's time, I'll take you to Hong Kong.
有空带妳去香港

58
00:06:31,000 --> 00:06:32,680
I'll introduce you to him.
把他介绍给妳认识

59
00:06:35,880 --> 00:06:37,960
Weren't you going to look for something?
妳不要找东西吗？

60
00:06:40,360 --> 00:06:41,320
Right.
对

61
00:06:42,480 --> 00:06:43,760
I'll be back down in a bit.
那我一会下来

62
00:06:43,840 --> 00:06:44,840
Have a seat.
你先坐

63
00:06:45,320 --> 00:06:46,320
Okay.
好

64
00:06:47,640 --> 00:06:49,520
Can I use that restroom?
那个洗手间可以用吗？

65
00:06:51,280 --> 00:06:52,960
(Restroom)
（卫生间）

66
00:06:53,040 --> 00:06:54,000
It's broken.
坏了

67
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:57,520
That restroom's broken.
这个洗手间坏了

68
00:06:57,600 --> 00:06:58,800
Use the one on the second floor.
用二楼的吧

69
00:07:00,320 --> 00:07:01,160
Okay.
好

70
00:07:02,120 --> 00:07:03,120
This way.
这边

71
00:07:03,200 --> 00:07:09,240
(Restroom)
（卫生间）

72
00:07:42,800 --> 00:07:43,880
Did you find it?
找到没啊？

73
00:07:47,120 --> 00:07:48,160
I don't know where I put it.
不知道放哪了

74
00:07:48,240 --> 00:07:49,880
I still have to keep looking.
我还得再找找

75
00:07:54,400 --> 00:07:55,840
It's alright.
没关系的啊

76
00:07:56,880 --> 00:07:58,440
Here works just fine for me too.
我在妳这里也可以啊

77
00:08:00,160 --> 00:08:01,160
What's wrong?
怎么了？

78
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,240
Feeling shy?
害羞了？

79
00:08:04,960 --> 00:08:06,800
It's not like it's your first time.
又不是第一次

80
00:08:08,400 --> 00:08:09,680
Just relax.
放轻松点

81
00:08:10,600 --> 00:08:11,760
Miss Shen.
沉小姐

82
00:08:13,440 --> 00:08:16,440
The difference between people and animals—
人和动物有什么区别

83
00:08:17,000 --> 00:08:18,240
do you know what it is?
妳知道吗？

84
00:08:22,160 --> 00:08:23,560
There's no difference.
没有区别的

85
00:08:25,040 --> 00:08:25,960
People—
人

86
00:08:26,520 --> 00:08:28,000
once they take off their clothes—
脱掉衣服之后

87
00:08:28,600 --> 00:08:29,960
aren't they just animals?
不就是动物了吗？

88
00:08:46,680 --> 00:08:48,080
I'm not an animal.
我不是动物

89
00:08:56,040 --> 00:08:57,200
I'm a person.
我是人

90
00:08:57,840 --> 00:08:59,280
I'm not an animal.
我不是动物

91
00:09:02,600 --> 00:09:03,600
Screw you.
去你的

92
00:09:05,800 --> 00:09:07,240
So it's a honey trap?
仙人跳啊？

93
00:09:08,040 --> 00:09:09,120
Playing me?
搞我？

94
00:09:09,200 --> 00:09:10,800
You dare play me?
妳敢搞我？

95
00:09:11,360 --> 00:09:12,600
Playing me?
搞我？

96
00:09:18,040 --> 00:09:19,080
Shen Mo!
沈墨

97
00:09:20,760 --> 00:09:22,000
Are you okay?
妳没事吧？

98
00:09:24,040 --> 00:09:25,000
It's an anesthetic.
麻药

99
00:09:25,080 --> 00:09:26,200
We can't let him get away.
不能让他走

100
00:09:27,040 --> 00:09:27,920
Screw you.
去你的

101
00:09:28,000 --> 00:09:31,080
The phone…
听电话…

102
00:10:25,000 --> 00:10:28,800
(Imperial Video Screening Room)
（皇朝录像厅）

103
00:11:09,840 --> 00:11:10,960
I'm sorry.
对不起

104
00:11:11,640 --> 00:11:13,160
I'm truly sorry.
真的对不起

105
00:11:13,880 --> 00:11:16,520
If I've offended you two in any way—
我有什么得罪你们的地方

106
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:18,000
I apologize.
我跟你们道歉

107
00:11:18,080 --> 00:11:20,400
You think an apology can fix what you've done?
你觉得你干过的事，道歉能解决吗？

108
00:11:21,280 --> 00:11:24,400
This whole thing really is a misunderstanding.
这件事情真的是误会

109
00:11:26,480 --> 00:11:29,680
I've always had the greatest respect for Miss Shen.
我一直很尊重沉小姐的

110
00:11:30,520 --> 00:11:32,840
It was Yin Hong who kept lying to me.
是殷红一直骗我

111
00:11:32,920 --> 00:11:34,760
She told me you were willing.
她說妳是愿意的

112
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:37,440
Here's what we'll do.
这样

113
00:11:37,520 --> 00:11:38,720
You let me go—
你们放我走

114
00:11:38,800 --> 00:11:40,960
there's an 800,000-yuan draft in my car.
我车上有一张八十万的汇票

115
00:11:41,040 --> 00:11:42,600
Consider it my compensation to you.
就算是我补偿你们的

116
00:11:42,680 --> 00:11:44,760
And this whole thing never happened.
这件事情就当没有发生过

117
00:11:47,360 --> 00:11:49,080
I'm a man of my word.
我说到做到啊

118
00:11:57,520 --> 00:11:59,200
You're going to stay right here today—
你今天就在这

119
00:11:59,280 --> 00:12:02,400
and write down clearly everything you've done in Hualin.
把你在桦林都干过什么 清清楚楚地写下来

120
00:12:05,920 --> 00:12:07,920
What do you want me to write?
你们想要我写什么？

121
00:12:10,280 --> 00:12:11,440
You're still fucking playing dumb?
你他妈还装？

122
00:12:11,520 --> 00:12:13,240
Is this the first time you've pulled this?
你是第一回干这种事吗？

123
00:12:13,320 --> 00:12:15,240
Every day in Hualin—
我每天在桦林

124
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:17,600
I have a lot of people to meet.
要见很多人的

125
00:12:18,920 --> 00:12:20,560
If I go missing—
如果我不见了

126
00:12:21,800 --> 00:12:24,920
plenty of people will come looking for me right away.
马上就会有很多人来找我的

127
00:12:25,480 --> 00:12:26,640
And another thing—
还有

128
00:12:26,720 --> 00:12:28,000
when you made that call—
妳打电话的时候

129
00:12:28,080 --> 00:12:29,680
my driver was right there.
我司机也在场的

130
00:12:30,200 --> 00:12:31,240
So here's the deal—
这样

131
00:12:31,320 --> 00:12:32,920
you let me go first—
你们先放我走

132
00:12:33,000 --> 00:12:35,200
and I can treat this whole thing—
我可以把这件事情

133
00:12:35,760 --> 00:12:37,600
as if it never happened.
当作没有发生过

134
00:12:41,520 --> 00:12:42,680
Make the call.
打电话

135
00:12:45,200 --> 00:12:46,840
Call your driver.
给你司机打电话

136
00:12:46,920 --> 00:12:48,280
Tell him you're fine.
告诉他你没事

137
00:12:48,840 --> 00:12:52,720
Have you two watched so many videotapes—
你们是不是录像带看多了

138
00:12:52,800 --> 00:12:54,480
that your brains have rotted?
把脑子看坏了？

139
00:12:59,440 --> 00:13:01,360
Kidnapping means prison, you know that?
绑架要坐牢的，知道吗？

140
00:13:03,080 --> 00:13:05,880
Somebody, help…!
来人呀…

141
00:13:12,440 --> 00:13:13,920
Make the call!
打电话！

142
00:13:19,760 --> 00:13:21,160
I'll call…
我打…

143
00:13:23,880 --> 00:13:29,840
I'll call…
我打…

144
00:13:31,600 --> 00:13:32,640
I'll call.
我打

145
00:13:33,560 --> 00:13:34,600
I'll call.
我打

146
00:13:46,320 --> 00:13:47,600
Hello? Xiao Luo.
喂？ 小罗

147
00:13:49,480 --> 00:13:50,840
It's… it's nothing.
没…没事

148
00:13:51,760 --> 00:13:53,280
I'm… I'm in…
我…我在…

149
00:13:54,000 --> 00:13:55,080
I'm in the restroom.
我在洗手间

150
00:13:55,680 --> 00:13:57,320
It's fine… really, it's fine.
没事…真没事

151
00:13:57,800 --> 00:13:58,840
That's all.
就这样

152
00:13:59,520 --> 00:14:02,120
If anything comes up, I'll call you again.
有什么事，我再给你电话

153
00:14:02,760 --> 00:14:04,200
Okay, bye.
好，掰掰

154
00:14:32,240 --> 00:14:34,480
What if he really tells them we kidnapped him?
他要真说咱是绑架怎么办？

155
00:14:36,640 --> 00:14:37,840
Let's cash out the money.
把钱取出来吧

156
00:14:38,480 --> 00:14:39,800
And get out of here.
咱们离开这

157
00:15:51,520 --> 00:15:52,560
I want to cash this.
取钱

158
00:15:53,400 --> 00:15:54,560
Cash all of it.
都取出来

159
00:16:06,800 --> 00:16:09,120
Sorry, sir, this one can't be cashed.
不好意思啊，您这个取不了

160
00:16:10,560 --> 00:16:11,680
Why not?
为啥？

161
00:16:18,120 --> 00:16:20,080
This is a commercial draft payable on a fixed date.
您这个是定日付款的商业汇票

162
00:16:20,160 --> 00:16:21,240
See, it says the 17th right here.
上面不写着17号吗？

163
00:16:21,320 --> 00:16:22,320
It can only be cashed on that date.
规定日期才能取的

164
00:16:28,720 --> 00:16:29,880
One moment, please.
您稍等一下

165
00:16:30,800 --> 00:16:32,560
This man says he wants to cash this.
这个人说要取钱

166
00:16:53,360 --> 00:16:56,080
Do you know the difference between people and animals?
你知道人和动物有什么区别吗？

167
00:17:02,040 --> 00:17:03,080
People—
人

168
00:17:05,800 --> 00:17:08,839
have to pay the price for what they've done.
得为自己做过的事付出代价

169
00:17:45,840 --> 00:17:50,200
(Restroom)
（卫生间）

170
00:17:52,640 --> 00:17:53,920
He lied to us.
他骗咱们

171
00:17:54,000 --> 00:17:55,720
I almost got detained at the bank.
我差点让银行给扣下

172
00:17:55,800 --> 00:17:57,360
That fucking bastard.
这他妈王八蛋

173
00:17:58,520 --> 00:17:59,680
Get up.
起来

174
00:18:00,640 --> 00:18:01,840
Get up.
起来

175
00:18:14,280 --> 00:18:15,480
He's dead.
他死了

176
00:18:27,680 --> 00:18:31,760
(Restroom)
（卫生间）

177
00:19:01,640 --> 00:19:03,200
I'm the one who killed him.
人是我杀的

178
00:19:05,360 --> 00:19:06,960
It's got nothing to do with you two.
跟你俩没关系

179
00:19:11,080 --> 00:19:12,400
Why?
为啥呀？

180
00:19:14,000 --> 00:19:17,280
We could've just cashed the money and left Hualin together, couldn't we?
咱们取了钱 一起离开桦林不就行了吗？

181
00:19:25,720 --> 00:19:29,720
Do you still want to leave with me now?
你现在还愿意跟我一起走吗？

182
00:19:45,960 --> 00:19:47,000
Go where?
去哪啊？

183
00:19:54,840 --> 00:19:57,000
Somewhere nobody knows us.
去一个没人认识的地方

184
00:19:59,280 --> 00:20:00,480
And live all over again.
重新活一次

185
00:22:28,080 --> 00:22:29,160
Who's there?
谁呀？

186
00:22:33,680 --> 00:22:34,800
What are you doing?
干啥呢？

187
00:22:50,960 --> 00:22:51,960
Wang Yang.
王阳

188
00:23:10,440 --> 00:23:11,680
It's a little hot.
有点热

189
00:23:12,200 --> 00:23:13,680
I'll go get you your medicine.
我去给你拿药

190
00:23:55,160 --> 00:23:56,760
We need to find a new place.
得找个新的地方

191
00:23:57,320 --> 00:23:58,520
We can't stay here anymore.
不能再住这了

192
00:24:00,480 --> 00:24:03,720
We'll lie low for a while, and once we get the money we'll come find you.
我们先躲一躲，等拿到钱了再去找你

193
00:24:19,080 --> 00:24:20,360
Go on back.
回去吧

194
00:24:21,320 --> 00:24:22,600
Get a good night's sleep.
好好睡一觉

195
00:24:25,040 --> 00:24:27,800
Just think of it as a dream.
就当是作了一场梦

196
00:24:31,080 --> 00:24:32,960
Wouldn't it be nice if it really were a dream?
要真是个梦多好啊？

197
00:24:34,640 --> 00:24:36,560
You wake up and nothing's changed.
醒了什么都没变

198
00:24:51,480 --> 00:24:52,600
Nothing will change.
不会变

199
00:24:55,680 --> 00:24:57,280
Nothing will ever change.
什么都不会变

200
00:25:05,400 --> 00:25:11,320
(Imperial Video Screening Room)
（皇朝录像厅）

201
00:25:53,400 --> 00:25:54,680
What are you here for?
妳来干嘛？

202
00:26:01,800 --> 00:26:03,280
Still angry?
还生气呢

203
00:26:05,000 --> 00:26:06,360
It's not that serious, is it?
不至于吧？

204
00:26:11,600 --> 00:26:14,760
Your handkerchief and your brother's clothes—I've washed them all clean.
妳的手绢、妳弟的衣服都洗干净了

205
00:26:14,840 --> 00:26:15,960
Just leave them there.
放那吧

206
00:26:21,520 --> 00:26:22,720
Where are you off to?
这是要去哪啊？

207
00:26:22,800 --> 00:26:23,960
Nowhere.
不去哪

208
00:26:27,520 --> 00:26:29,720
You should go. I've got things to do.
妳走吧，我还有事

209
00:26:49,000 --> 00:26:50,320
What things?
啥事啊？

210
00:26:54,280 --> 00:26:56,360
You're not going to Hong Kong with President Lu, are you?
不是要跟卢总去香港吧？

211
00:27:03,760 --> 00:27:04,920
Quit pretending.
别装了

212
00:27:06,320 --> 00:27:08,280
When you called to set up that meeting with President Lu—
妳打电话约卢总的时候

213
00:27:08,360 --> 00:27:09,680
I heard all of it.
我都听到了

214
00:27:13,440 --> 00:27:14,440
So what?
怎么的？

215
00:27:14,960 --> 00:27:16,360
Figured it out, have you?
想明白了？

216
00:27:17,160 --> 00:27:18,520
How much is he paying you?
他给妳多少钱啊？

217
00:27:29,320 --> 00:27:30,480
800,000.
八十万

218
00:27:36,840 --> 00:27:38,600
Never seen that much money before, have you?
没见过这么多钱吧？

219
00:27:46,000 --> 00:27:48,560
College girls really are a different fucking breed.
大学生还真他妈不一样啊

220
00:27:51,640 --> 00:27:54,040
Lu Wenzhong handing you that kind of money—
卢文仲给妳这么多钱

221
00:27:55,720 --> 00:27:57,720
your little boyfriend doesn't know, does he?
妳那小男朋友不知道吧？

222
00:28:00,080 --> 00:28:01,280
No, he doesn't.
不知道

223
00:28:06,200 --> 00:28:07,840
You really know how to play the game.
还是妳会玩

224
00:28:10,760 --> 00:28:12,440
You get to have it all.
什么都让妳占了

225
00:28:29,880 --> 00:28:31,320
He doesn't know now—
他现在不知道

226
00:28:32,040 --> 00:28:33,840
but that doesn't mean he won't find out later.
不一定以后就不知道

227
00:28:36,120 --> 00:28:37,440
Don't get me wrong.
别误会

228
00:28:37,520 --> 00:28:39,280
I'm not threatening you.
我可不是威胁妳

229
00:28:44,480 --> 00:28:46,360
Coming into this fortune—
妳发这笔财

230
00:28:47,360 --> 00:28:49,520
shouldn't you be thanking me?
是不是应该感谢我？

231
00:28:57,680 --> 00:28:58,920
Take it.
妳拿走吧

232
00:29:02,520 --> 00:29:04,400
Isn't it me you wanted to become?
妳不是想变成我吗？

233
00:29:09,640 --> 00:29:11,960
Take this, and you can become me.
拿走这个，妳就可以变成我了

234
00:29:19,760 --> 00:29:21,840
Then I won't stand on ceremony.
那我可不跟妳客气了

235
00:29:22,600 --> 00:29:23,840
Thanks.
谢了

236
00:29:36,040 --> 00:29:37,520
You fucking bitch—
妳他妈的

237
00:30:59,440 --> 00:31:00,920
Was Yin Hong here?
殷红来了？

238
00:31:47,520 --> 00:31:49,360
Why did you do it?
为什么这么做？

239
00:31:56,920 --> 00:31:58,800
Yin Hong is gone.
殷红没了

240
00:32:03,520 --> 00:32:05,320
She's me now.
她现在是我了

241
00:32:11,000 --> 00:32:13,400
Once you're dead, you don't have to believe in fate anymore.
人死了就不用再信命了

242
00:32:16,840 --> 00:32:18,280
Stop looking for Wang Yang.
别再找王阳了

243
00:32:19,440 --> 00:32:21,440
He can go on living a good life.
他可以好好活着

244
00:37:18,200 --> 00:37:19,120
A bowl of wontons, please.
来碗馄饨

245
00:37:19,760 --> 00:37:22,160
All out. That guy bought up the last three bowls.
没有了，最后三碗全让他包圆了

246
00:37:37,560 --> 00:37:38,600
Thanks.
谢谢啊
